  "releaseNotes": "1.2.2 — Fixed the base64 image size guard (Anthropic's 10 MB limit is on the encoded string, not the decoded file). Documents now get the same unsupported-format/oversize guard as images (base64 must be application/pdf, 32 MB max). Base64 payloads are stripped of embedded whitespace before sending. Added file_id/text/content document sources, guarded against forwarding a file_id minted by another provider.",
